flowchart LR
  A[Intake] --> B[Document collection]
  B --> C{Completeness check}
  C -- Missing --> B
  C -- Complete --> D[Risk / exception escalation]
  D --> E{Authorised compliance decision}
  E -- Approve --> F[Account activation]
  E -- Reject --> G[Close and record reason]
  F --> H[Periodic review]
  H --> D
